WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.264
Energy usually moves in patterns rather than staying flat all day.

2
00:00:04.264 --> 00:00:10.584
Many people have windows when focus comes more easily and windows when startup friction is higher.

3
00:00:10.584 --> 00:00:13.554
Some people do their clearest thinking early.

4
00:00:13.554 --> 00:00:15.458
Others become sharper later.

5
00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:20.712
Some notice an afternoon dip, especially after intense cognitive or social work.

6
00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:23.072
These patterns are not moral traits.

7
00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:25.128
They are planning information.

8
00:00:25.128 --> 00:00:28.326
Startup friction is the effort required to begin.

9
00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:34.418
It is often higher after a context switch, a break, a stressful interaction, or an unclear task.

10
00:00:34.418 --> 00:00:45.155
Good systems reduce startup friction by making the next action obvious, keeping materials ready, and avoiding unnecessary decisions at the moment work should begin.

11
00:00:45.155 --> 00:00:50.409
Energy-aware planning pays attention to the start of work, not just the deadline.

12
00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:53.150
Recovery after intense work also matters.

13
00:00:53.150 --> 00:01:04.267
A difficult incident, a long facilitation session, a creative push, or several hours of deep analysis may require a lower-demand transition before the next demanding task.

14
00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:13.405
Seasonal pressures, caregiving responsibilities, travel, health context, workload spikes, and major life events can all change capacity.

15
00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:19.420
A system that assumes every day should look the same will misread normal variation as failure.

16
00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:22.542
Observation helps without becoming obsessive.

17
00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:30.766
A simple weekly note can identify when deep work went well, when energy dipped, what drained capacity, and what helped recovery.

18
00:01:30.766 --> 00:01:33.736
The purpose is not to measure every sensation.

19
00:01:33.736 --> 00:01:36.096
The purpose is to plan more honestly.

20
00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:46.071
When patterns are visible, people can protect better windows, reduce predictable drains, and avoid forcing high-consequence work into weak conditions.
